id: pm-fb0lkg
title: Evaluate and refresh @sentry/node 10.70 with packed-consumer proof
description: "Evaluate the registry-current @sentry/node 10.70.0 release discovered during final dependency closeout, adopt it only if the runtime, strict NodeNext declaration graph, isolated packed consumer, telemetry gate, security scans, and exact repository coverage all pass, and leave the separately canonical npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 major deferrals unchanged."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
