completed_at: "2026-08-11T14:41:55.499Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml resolve @sentry/node 10.70.0 with no 10.69 runtime residue; the strict packed NodeNext SDK consumer and executable containment gates pass against a fresh tarball; Sentry telemetry audit security typecheck package and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage gates pass; pnpm outdated reports only the canonically deferred npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 majors
value: Keep observability current without repeating the Sentry 10.68 published-declaration regression.
outcome: A reproducible safe 10.70 adoption or an evidence-backed incompatibility disposition.
why_now: The final all-dependency inventory after PR #977 found 10.70.0 as the sole unowned compatible candidate.
