risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: Safely upgraded the public Sentry runtime to 10.70.0 and merged the packed-consumer compatibility proof in PR #978.
expected_result: "Sentry 10.70.0 resolves without older runtime residue and passes packed NodeNext consumer, executable, coverage, audit, telemetry, and security gates."
actual_result: "PR #978 merged the 10.70.0 graph after exact packed-consumer, 100/100/100/100 coverage, audit, telemetry, security, and hosted checks passed; only the external CodeFactor status remained pending after merge."
