comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T11:15:12.377Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence 2026-08-11: all-status searches for @sentry/node 10.70.0 and Sentry dependency refreshes found the closed 10.68 rejection pm-r31390 and successful 10.69 refresh pm-7564ov, but no item owns 10.70.0. The final PR #977 dependency inventory discovered this candidate after pm-67b84b closed; incompatible npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 majors remain canonically owned by pm-ksr40d and pm-do5b."
  "2026-08-11T11:34:40.745Z","harness:codex","TDD and compatibility evidence 2026-08-11: upgrading to @sentry/node 10.70.0 first produced the intended red package-manifest ratchet (expected 10.69.0). After updating that existing contract and rationale, 87 linked focused tests and an expanded 110-test Sentry/package/packed-smoke set passed. The real smoke-npx-from-pack temporary-project workflow exited successfully, proving the packed executable and strict NodeNext consumer declaration graph. Exact repository coverage then passed all 7,223 tests across 483 files at 100/100/100/100; typecheck, ESLint, zero-duplicate detection, package artifact, Sentry/telemetry, and audit gates also pass. pnpm outdated now reports only the separately tracked npm-package-arg 14 and TypeScript 7 majors."
  "2026-08-11T12:05:02.564Z","harness:codex","Exact-head review closeout 2026-08-11: PR #978 head b840d9f1d8b4114d427f722ded1de41d6742171e is mergeable and every repository-owned CI, coverage, security, static-analysis, cross-platform, package, benchmark, and available review check passed. Sourcery findings were dispositioned; CodeRabbit was rate-limited and is recorded as unavailable rather than approval; every automated comment/review has been reacted to and acknowledged. CodeFactor remains IN_PROGRESS beyond the full 25-minute review window and is a required branch-protection check, so GitHub reports mergeStateStatus BLOCKED. No protection bypass was attempted; the item stays claimed and in_progress solely because the required external gate has not reached a terminal state."
  "2026-08-11T14:41:54.854Z","harness:codex","Live closeout 2026-08-11: PR #978 was externally merged at 2026-08-11T14:15:59Z as 2ccf5d3682fa7cb9e4258926342a69b3f1a7f1f4 after all repository-owned, security, coverage, cross-platform, package, benchmark, and available review checks passed. The merged main contains the validated @sentry/node 10.70.0 graph. CodeFactor still reports pending after merge and is retained as an external-provider limitation, not represented as approval."
  "2026-08-11T16:29:53.206Z","harness:codex","Delivery lineage: included in broad PR #981 (https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/981), coordinated by pm-ajj4r7 through exact-head review, merge, and immutable release verification."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T11:34:41.416Z","harness:codex",Exact dependency pins should be guarded by a deliberately red version ratchet plus a real packed strict-consumer compile; registry engine compatibility alone would not have caught the prior Sentry 10.68 declaration defect.
